== approval, the version has no creator (excludeAuthor) (kardinal why demo prod)
prod is held by gate cab: nobody can approve this version.
  Version  sha-9349a3f (demo-zhxk2)
  Why      the gate excludes the version's author, and the version has no verified creator (kardinal.io/created-by)
  Next     ship it again as yourself: kardinal ship demo --image <ref>
  Or       kardinal override demo prod --gate cab --reason <why>

